('R8-vp-edge-limit-nq', 'R8', 'Weekly VP (from Sunday open, frozen 09:29 ET): limit long at VAL / short at VAH, target POC, stop 0.15–0.4 ATR, flat at close (YouTube order-flow video, mechanised)', 'NQ', '2010–2026', 3784, 0.84, -9.01, '2/17', 'no edge', 'Best of 9 settings PF 0.84; requiring POC ≥ 0.5–1 ATR away makes it worse (0.40–0.81).', '2026-10-11'),
