('R8-big-down-day-nq', 'R8', 'After a big down day (prior body ≤ −1 ATR): long 09:30 → close', 'NQ', '2010–2026', 258, 1.91, 2.95, '14/17', 'weak', 'No stop: PF 1.91 (t 2.95), stronger the bigger the down day (−1.5 ATR: PF 3.13, 84 trades). With a 0.5 ATR stop PF 1.20 (t 0.91); profit concentrated in 2022 and 2025; ES PF 1.50, t 0.68.', '2026-10-11'),
