('R9-weakness-system-nq', 'R9', 'Buy-weakness intraday system: 7 signals (big down day, 3+ down closes, weak close, 3-day drop, ANY, score) × 5 entries (open, 10:00, dip 0.25/0.5 ATR, OR-high break) × 4 stops, flat 15:59; split 2010–18 / 2019–26', 'NQ+ES', '2010–2026', 257, 1.91, 2.86, '14/17', 'weak', 'Only the big-down-day signal (prior body ≤ −1 ATR) holds in both halves on NQ (PF 1.61 / 2.00); combining signals dilutes it. ES: dip 0.5 ATR entry PF 2.27 (t 2.18). 2023–26 tick-built bars + 1 pt extra slip: PF 1.68, but 2025 carries it and 2026 is −533 pts. Payout sim (train 2010–19, test 2020–26), Select Flex 50K: best EV $232/account at 3 MNQ with a 1 ATR stop, 1% blown, but 0% paid within 20 days — ~15 trades a year is too few for 1–2-week payouts.', '2026-10-11'),
('R10-fear-daily', 'R10', 'Buy fear, daily triggers known at 09:30 (big down day, big range day, ATR expansion, gap down ± uptrend) × entries (open, 10:00, dip 0.25/0.5 ATR) × stops, long, flat 15:59', 'NQ+ES', '2010–2026', NULL, 2.46, 2.88, '13/17', 'weak', '9 of 48 hold (PF > 1 in 2010–18 and 2019–26 on both NQ and ES), all big-down-day or big-range-down-day. Best: prior range ≥1.5 ATR and down, buy a 0.5 ATR dip, NQ PF 2.46 (t 2.88), ES 1.71; open entry 17.7 trades/yr. ES adds 62 signal days to NQ''s 257. Payout sim 50K (test 2020–26): best single EV $177 (ES-based, 5 MNQ, 9% blown); 4-series portfolio at 5 MNQ EV $886, 23% blown, $377/month alive — but 0% paid within 20 days.', '2026-10-11'),
('R10-fear-intraday', 'R10', 'Buy fear intraday: drop ≥ 0.75/1/1.5 ATR from the open or the session high by 10:30/11:00/12:00/13:00 (± uptrend), buy at that time or on a 15-min-high break, stops none / day low / 1 ATR', 'NQ+ES', '2010–2026', NULL, 1.16, 0.20, '7/17', 'no edge', '1 of 288 variants holds on both markets and halves, at PF 1.16 / t 0.20.', '2026-10-11'),
('R11-confluence-pullback', 'R11', 'Confluence trend pullback on 5m bars: above rising VWAP, EMA20 above VWAP, impulse to a new session extreme ≥ 0.5/1 ATR, pullback to EMA20 holding VWAP, close beyond the prior bar; stop under the pullback (≤ 0.6 ATR); exits close / 2R / EMA20 break; long + short; ± gap-with / no-fear filters', 'NQ+ES', '2010–2026', NULL, 1.64, 0.08, '10/17', 'no edge', '0 of 144 variants hold (PF > 1 in both halves on both markets). NQ positive only 2019–26 (best PF 2.05 there, 0.39–0.61 in 2010–18); ES loses in every variant. Median NQ PF 0.78.', '2026-10-11'),
('R12-wf-model', 'R12', 'Walk-forward model (logistic / gradient boosting, 14 daily NQ+ES features known at 09:30) predicting the RTH open→close direction; each year 2014–26 trained only on earlier years; long/short at p thresholds 0.50/0.55/0.60', 'NQ', '2014–2026', 2982, 1.03, 0.48, '6/13', 'no edge', 'PF 0.91–1.03 when trading most days; the 0.60 logistic threshold PF 1.48 on 118 trades is carried by 2025.', '2026-10-11')
